sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator browser
    participant Web as React /admin/login
    participant API as NestJS admin-auth
    participant DB as AdminUser table

    Op->>Web: Username, password, optional checkboxes
    Note over Web: Remember username → localStorage only
    Note over Web: Stay signed in → rememberMe in JSON body
    Web->>API: POST /api/admin/auth/login { username, password, rememberMe? }
    API->>DB: Find AdminUser by username
    DB-->>API: passwordHash (or null)
    API->>API: verifyPasswordTimingSafe (bcrypt)
    alt valid credentials
        alt rememberMe true
            API->>API: Long TTL payload + Set-Cookie Max-Age (persistent)
        else rememberMe false / omitted
            API->>API: Short TTL payload + session cookie (no Max-Age)
        end
        API->>API: Audit admin_login_success (metadata.rememberMe if long)
        API-->>Web: Set-Cookie + ok, admin, csrfToken
        Web->>Web: Optional localStorage username
        Web->>Web: navigate to /admin
        Web->>API: GET /api/admin/auth/me (credentials)
        API-->>Web: { admin, csrfToken }
    else invalid credentials
        API-->>Web: 401 Invalid credentials
    end

    Op->>Web: Session expired / 401 on admin route
    Web->>Web: Redirect /admin/login?reason=session_expired

    Op->>Web: Logout
    Web->>API: POST /api/admin/auth/logout (X-CSRF-Token when session present)
    API-->>Web: Clear cookie + { ok: true }
    Note over Web: Remembered username kept in localStorage
